[[2047,96,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The integrated services control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               which\nmanages the operation of the central locking.</p><p>The direct supply for the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40\n(pin 8 of connector B) arrives directly from the battery via the\nline protect by maxifuse J/B2  (of B99)  and fuse F8 of the junction\nunit B1.</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; pin 13 of connector B provides the reference earth.</p><p>The receiver of the remote control \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M35\nreceives a supply controlled by the ignition  (INT) from the line\nfor fuse F1 of the junction unit B1 and directly from the battery\nvia the line of the maxifuse J/B1 (of B99) and fuse F10 of the junction\nunit B1.</strong></p><p>The control unit M40 receives the following inputs:</p><ul><li>commands coming from the front locks <strong>N50</strong> and <strong>N51</strong> for\nlocking (pin 15 of connector B) or for unlocking (pin 16 of connector\nB) the doors;</li><li>signals on the state of the door locks, coming from the\nfour geared motors <strong>N50, N51, N55 and N56, respectively at pins\n2 and 3 of connector B and 3 and 7 of connector C. \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                     See E2510  COURTESY LIGHTS \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    .</strong></li><li>the signals from the remote control <strong>M35</strong> receiver\nfor locking (pin 6 of connector C) or for unlocking (pin 15 of connector\nC);</li><li>the signal for the inertia switch <strong>I50</strong> at pin 10\nof connector B;</li></ul><p>In accordance with the strategy described\nabove, the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls the locks: the signals\nfor the motors of the front doors (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N51</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) and\nrear doors (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N55</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N56</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) come from pins 4 and 5 of\nconnector B.</p>"]]